WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.670
《匹兹堡医护前线 第二季》
本影片由米奇爸爸
基于HBOMax官方译文制作

2
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:13.670
阿尔医生?
Dr. Al?

3
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.090
阿尔医生
Dr. Al.

4
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:20.640
后门有外伤病人
Trauma's at the back door.

5
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.150
等她其余的化验结果出来了通知我
Let me know when the rest of her labs are back.

6
00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.070
那个女友并没有多大帮助
The girlfriend hasn't been much help.

7
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.940
她不配合吗? 不是的
Is she being uncooperative? No, not really.

8
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.360
显然 她跟那个小女孩凯莉的父亲
Apparently, she's only been going out with the little girl Kylie's father

9
00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.450
只约会了几个月
for a few months.

10
00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:41.820
早上8点

11
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.160
他现在在哪? 他在纽卡斯尔出差
Where is he now? He's in New Castle for work.

12
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.080
我给他留言了 让他来医院
I left him a message to come in.

13
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.750
好吧 等他到了来找我
Okay, come find me when he gets here.

14
00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.540
你这周跟心理创伤咨询师聊过了吗?
You talk to the trauma counselor this week?

15
00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:50.460
我正打算去
I'm going to.

16
00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:52.880
我保证 很好
Promise. Okay, good.

17
00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.500
救护车刚到 我马上过去
Medics are rolling in. I'll be right there.

18
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.840
从楼梯摔下来的小女孩怎么样了?
How's our little girl who took a stair tumble?

19
00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.550
我要给她做个超声 看是否有内出血
I'm going to check for internal hemorrhage with an ultrasound.

20
00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.970
你的直觉呢?
What is your gut telling you?

21
00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:02.840
她的直觉? 对
Her gut? Yeah.

22
00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.810
这是人工智能永远不会有的东西
It's this thing that AI will never have.

23
00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:08.480
我现在不想去思考我的直觉
I don't want to think about what my gut is saying right now.

24
00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:11.770
有后续情况记得来找我 找我们 如果你不介意的话
Come find me when you know more. Us, if you don't mind.

25
00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:14.310
我不介意 有后续情况来找我们
I don't mind. Us, come find us when you know more.

26
00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.030
这台外科手术你要上吗? 我实在抽不开身
Do you want to jump on this trauma? I've got my hands full.

27
00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:18.780
我必须查清楚这件事
I don't want this one getting away from me.

28
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.200
我们还没了解全貌呢 别急着下结论
We don't know what this is yet. Don't go jumping to conclusions.

29
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.950
我没有下任何结论 我只是为了我的病人着想
I'm not jumping to anything. I'm just looking out for my patient.

30
00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.540
关于桑托斯 有什么我该知道的吗?
Something I should know about Santos?

31
00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:33.000
非常自信 不害怕趟浑水
Very confident, not afraid to get her hands dirty,

32
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.920
坚定维护患者的权益 无所畏惧
strong patient advocate, fearless.

33
00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:37.170
你刚才好像在暗示她妄下结论
Seems like you were suggesting she jumps to conclusions.

34
00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.550
不 我只是建议或者说提醒她 别那么做 什么事?
No, no, no, no. I was merely suggesting or reminding her not to. Yeah.

35
00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:43.640
58岁男性 跌倒致舟骨骨折
58-year-old guy. Tripped with a scaphoid fracture.

36
00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.470
鼻出血 神经系统检查 无局灶性体征
Epistaxis, non-focal neuro,

37
00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:46.890
但否认有撞到头部
but denies head trauma.

38
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.980
但每次我给他检查 他的情绪状态都在恶化
But every time I check on him, his affect has drastically changed.

39
00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.230
我的直觉告诉我有哪里不对劲
My gut is telling me something's not right.

40
00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.610
怎么了? 没什么
What? Nothing.

41
00:01:58.610 --> 00:01:59.940
你有什么计划
Your play.

42
00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:03.030
先做个头部CT 如果正常的话 再做腰椎穿刺 排除脑炎
Start with a head CT. If normal, LP, rule out encephalitis.

43
00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:04.530
就这么办吧
Put in your orders.

44
00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:06.160
他以前来过吗? 没有
Has he been here before? No.

45
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.240
你联系过家属
Have you called the family

46
00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:09.160
排除心理疾病史了吗? 没有 但我会的
to rule out any psychiatric history? No, but I will.

47
00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:11.250
与此同时 你要参与这个外伤病例吗?
Do you want to jump on this trauma in the meantime?

48
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.250
是什么情况? 是个惊喜
What is it? It's a surprise.

49
00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.380
好极了
Wonderful.

50
00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.500
梅尔 你要来吗? 什么情况?
Mel, you want to jump on this? What is it?

51
00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:21.510
是个惊喜
It's a surprise.

52
00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:22.840
给我们介绍一下情况 安博伊
What do you got for us, Amboy?

53
00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:25.550
艾伦·比林斯 一托盘屋顶瓦片 从两米高处坠落
Allen Billings. Pallet of roofing tiles fell eight feet,

54
00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:28.220
击中其上臂 造成开放式脱位
hit his upper arm with an open dislocation.

55
00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:29.260
好痛
Ouch.

56
00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:31.720
两轮芬太尼 第一轮每公斤1微克 第二轮每公斤0.5微克
Two rounds of fent, 1 then 0.5 per kilo.

57
00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:33.230
意识清醒 定向良好 生命体征良好
A and O, with good vitals.

58
00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:35.560
梅尔 扶稳他的胳膊 好的
Mel, hold the arm steady. Sure.

59
00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:41.110
比林斯先生 我是麦凯医生
Mr. Billings, I'm Dr. McKay.

60
00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:42.820
我是外科的加西亚医生
And I'm Dr. Garcia from surgery.

61
00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.650
这位是金医生 嗨
And this is Dr. King. Hi.

62
00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:45.610
真的好痛
Oh, it really hurts.

63
00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.990
给我们一分钟 我们会处理你的伤口 好吗?
Give us a minute. And we're gonna take care of that, okay?

64
00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:50.160
有头痛 胸痛或腹痛吗? 没有 只有胳膊
Any headache, chest or belly pain? No, just the arm.

65
00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:53.450
血氧饱和度99 脉搏104 高压116 低压78
Sats 99. Pulse 104. BP 116/78.

66
00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.830
你怎么看 金医生?
What do you think, Dr. King?

67
00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:56.960
这是开放性脱位
Oh, it is an open dislocation.

68
00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.290
能再具体一点吗?
Can you be more specific?

69
00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.750
我觉得是骨头向下脱出关节
I think it's inferior, yeah?

70
00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.420
你记得专业术语叫什么吗?
Do you remember the name for that?

71
00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:09.470
听上去很像《哈利·波特》里的咒语
Sounds like a Harry Potter spell.

72
00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:13.180
直举性脱位
I... Luxatio erecta.

73
00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:14.930
正确 检查神经血管循环状况
Correct. Check the neuro-circ.

74
00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:16.730
先生 你能感觉到我的触碰吗?
Sir, can you feel me touching you?

75
00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.860
好的 你可以动一下手指吗? 可以
Okay. Can you wiggle your fingers? Yeah.

76
00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.900
桡动脉搏动良好 床旁超声检查阴性
Good radial pulse. E-FAST is negative.

77
00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.530
好的 接下来做什么 麦凯医生?
Okay, what's next, Dr. McKay?

78
00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:30.740
注射头孢唑林与庆大霉素 镇静后进行牵引和反牵引复位
Ancef and gentamicin. Sedate for traction, countertraction.

79
00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.410
他需要做个CT血管造影 排除血管损伤
And he needs a CT angiogram to rule out vascular injury.

80
00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:34.410
听上去很合理
That sounds like a plan.

81
00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.540
但因为有关节开放性损伤 他需要去手术室由骨科医生灌洗清创
But with an open joint, he needs a washout in the OR with ortho.

82
00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.460
同意 而不是在这里浪费时间
Agreed. Instead of wasting time down here,

83
00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.800
在全身麻醉下复位应该会更容易 风险也更低
it should be easier to reduce under general anesthesia with fewer risks.

84
00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.880
有可能
Possibly.

85
00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.630
我们问一下骨科的意见吧
Let's get an opinion from ortho.

86
00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.340
一看你就是新来的 医生 想法太乐观了
You're definitely new, Doctor. Wishful thinking.

87
00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.100
骨科不喜欢管闲事
Ortho like to take their sweet time.

88
00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.850
好了 给他镇静吧 麦凯医生
Okay, sedation orders, Dr. McKay.

89
00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.020
100毫克丙泊酚 滴注至起效
100 of propofol. Titrate to effect.

90
00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:56.140
我去备药
Be back with that.

91
00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:57.390
让一下
Excuse me.

92
00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.570
今天过得怎么样 医生?
How's your day going, Doc?

93
00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.440
挺好的
Yeah, pretty good.

94
00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.820
看来你的白蛋白已经输上了
Looks like your albumin's infusing.

95
00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.620
医学生奥吉尔维和乔伊
Oh, medical students Ogilvie and Kwon are gonna be working with me.

96
00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.240
会来协助我 你好
Hello. Student doctors.

97
00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:16.700
我们是实习医生 你想让他们试试吗?
You want them to try it?

98
00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.170
他们早晚都得上手
They got to learn sometime.

99
00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.130
他们第一次还是观摩比较好
It's best if they watch the first one.

100
00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:22.840
我可以做术前消毒和铺单 好的
I can prep and drape. Yeah.

101
00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:26.460
在你的白蛋白输完之后 没错
After your albumin's in. That's correct.

102
00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:27.760
为预防低血压
To prevent hypotension,

103
00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:31.720
如果我们预计失血量超过五升 会给予白蛋白
we introduce albumin if we anticipate more than five liters.

104
00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:33.050
上一次是六升
Last time it was six.

105
00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.600
那相当于是一加仑半
That's, like, a gallon and a half.

106
00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:37.140
高标号优质汽油
Of high-octane premium.

107
00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.980
好的 你还需要什么吗 路易先生?
Okay, you need anything else, Mr. Louie?

108
00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.400
不用了 女士 好的
No, ma'am. Okay.

109
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.980
你准备好了叫我 好的
Grab me when you're ready? Yeah.

110
00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.940
维塔克 你今早那个放弃抢救的病人 家属在中央区8号
Whitaker, wife of your DNR this morning is in Central 8.

111
00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.950
她知道她丈夫死了吗?
Does she know her husband died?

112
00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:50.320
等你告诉她就知道了
Not till you tell her.

113
00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:52.570
我马上过去
I'll be right there.

114
00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:58.160
好的 务必要先找到积液区 再确认进针点
Yeah, always make sure your entry point is safe by identifying the pocket of fluid.

115
00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.250
这样才能保证安全
That's not a pocket.

116
00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.080
这哪是积液区 这简直是个湖
That's a lake.

117
00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.590
是的 但你不想进针时 扎到静脉或动脉
Yeah, but you do not want to hit a vein or artery on the way in,

118
00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:06.550
所以一定要用彩色多普勒确认下
so make sure you check with color Doppler.

119
00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.010
乔伊?
Joy?

120
00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:12.890
我看不到了 我什么都看不到
I can't see. I can't see anything.

121
00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.800
因为你的眼睛是闭着的 我睁不开
That's 'cause your eye is shut. I can't open it.

122
00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:17.270
我贴假睫毛的时候被胶水粘住了
It's glued shut. I was trying to put on lashes.

123
00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:20.890
我的天啊 我会瞎吗?
Oh, my God. Oh, my God, am I gonna go blind?

124
00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:23.020
不会 我相信我们能解决这个问题
No, no, I'm pretty sure this is something we can fix.

125
00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.150
深吸一口气
Just take a deep breath.

126
00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:27.940
好的
Okay.

127
00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:30.900
你用什么把眼皮粘住了?
Okay, so you glued your eye shut with what exactly?

128
00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:31.860
超级胶水
Super glue.

129
00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.990
好吧 你平时贴假睫毛 都是用这个胶水吗?
Okay. Well, is it something you typically use to apply your lashes?

130
00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:36.780
不是 这东西通常是用来
No, it's typically something you use

131
00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:39.080
粘你摔碎的东西 比如咖啡杯之类的
to glue shit you break, like coffee mugs and stuff.

132
00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.580
你知道我在说什么 那是超级胶水
You know what I'm talking about. It's super glue.

133
00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.000
好的 明白了
Okay, okay. Yeah, got it.

134
00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.380
你能叫J医生来吗?她知道怎么办
Can I just talk to Dr. J? She'll know what to do.

135
00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.880
她是眼科医生吗?
Is that an ophthalmologist?

136
00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.590
不是 她在急诊工作
No, she works here in the ER.

137
00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:52.840
好吧 恐怕不行
Yeah, I don't think so,

138
00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.470
但我知道自己在做什么
but I know what I'm doing...

139
00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.640
大部分时候是
most of the time.

140
00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.140
进行Z形注射时
For a Z-track, we pull up the skin

141
00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:05.230
我们在进针至腹膜腔前 会先将皮肤提起
before advancing into the peritoneal space.

142
00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:07.650
看上去没问题
Looks good.

143
00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:08.690
液体是清亮的
Fluid's clear.

144
00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.820
真有看上去那么疼吗?
Does that hurt as much as it looks?

145
00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.110
也没那么糟啦
Oh, it's not too bad.

146
00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:15.570
奥吉尔维 帮我插上瓶子 好的
Ogilvie, spike the bottle for me. Okay.

147
00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:17.620
我们要用这些液体做什么化验?
What tests do we want on these fluids?

148
00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:19.910
腹水细胞计数 排除自发性细菌性腹膜炎
Cell count to rule out spontaneous bacterial peritonitis.

149
00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:23.000
答对了!确诊标准是什么 乔伊?
Ding. What would make that diagnosis, Joy?

150
00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.290
腹水中性粒细胞绝对值超过250
Absolute neutrophil count over 250.

151
00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.050
这边情况如何?
How are we doing in here?

152
00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:31.420
他们做得很好
They are doing great.

153
00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.130
我想他们没问题
I think they got this.

154
00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.060
嘿 达娜 你能叫琪拉雅下来吗?
Hey, Dana, can you get Kiara down here for me?

155
00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.640
她没接电话 她今天请假了 替她班的是...
She isn't answering her Spectralink. She's not working today. It's...

156
00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.140
我忘了 我会查一下 然后让他们下来
I forget. I'll find out and get 'em down here.

157
00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:48.730
你还需要别的什么吗? 一杯双份意式浓缩马提尼怎么样?
What else you need? How about a double espresso martini?

158
00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.280
我欣赏你的心态
I like the way you think.

159
00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:54.650
嘿 特鲁迪 我是达娜 你那边还好吗?
Hey, Trudy, it's Dana. What's going on up there?

160
00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:55.740
你怎么样 宕机女孩?
What's up, Crash?

161
00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:59.160
你是说除了被我妈逼疯之外吗?
You mean besides my mother driving me insane?

162
00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:02.540
你就跟她说 她的努力 如果用在我这样的人身上
Just tell her that her efforts would be better suited endorsing someone like myself.

163
00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.330
会得到更大的回报

164
00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.250
如果你真的在考虑 完成两个住院医师项目
If you're seriously thinking of a double residency,

165
00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.250
我劝你打消这个念头吧 你做不到
let me save you the trouble-you can't do it.

166
00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.720
为什么?因为你做不到吗?
Why? Just because you couldn't do it?

167
00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:17.680
老实说 没错
Honestly, yes.

168
00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:18.970
因为你是个天才
Because you're a genius.

169
00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:20.970
是的
Yes.

170
00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:22.810
841的平方根是多少?
What's the square root of 841?

171
00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.930
我不是人形计算器
I'm not a human calculator.

172
00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.480
社工迪伦·伊森这周末替琪拉雅的班
Social worker Dylan Easton is covering for Kiara this weekend.

173
00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.560
他马上就到
They're on their way down.

174
00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:30.020
谢谢 不客气
Thank you. Yep.

175
00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.110
该死
Oh, shit.

176
00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.740
我接诊了一位患结膜炎的修女
I have a nun with conjunctivitis.

177
00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:37.240
她的拭子样本查出了 革兰氏阴性细胞内双球菌
Her swab is showing gram-negative intracellular diplococci.

178
00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.200
淋病?
Gonorrhea?

179
00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.870
来信靠耶稣吧
Come to Jesus.

180
00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.700
肯定是实验室搞错了
Well, the lab must have made a mistake.

181
00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:46.000
也许是像“圣灵感孕”一样的神迹
Maybe it's an immaculate infection.

182
00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.040
我打给实验室主管把事情问清楚 谨言慎行 小姑娘
I'll call the lab supe, clear this up. Tread carefully, missy.

183
00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:53.210
那可是一个眼睛染了淋病的修女
There's a nun with gonorrhea in her eye.

184
00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:57.470
你们真的要让我错过这场好戏吗?
Seriously, you guys are gonna take this away from me?

185
00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.010
我对你们俩很失望
I'm disappointed in you two.

186
00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.220
29
29.

187
00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:02.560
什么?
What?

188
00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:03.930
841的平方根是29
The square root of 841.

189
00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.930
狄格比先生怎么样了?
How we doing with Mr. Digby?

190
00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:08.850
他在南区21号病房 换好病号服了
He's in a gown in South 21.

191
00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:10.610
我们能把他的衣物洗了吗?
Is there someplace we can get this laundered?

192
00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:12.320
这些东西会直接丢进焚烧炉
Those are going right in the incinerator.

193
00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.320
我们会给他一套新衣服
We'll get him a whole new wardrobe.

194
00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:17.070
你用过石膏锯吗?你当然没有
You ever use a cast saw before? Of course you haven't.

195
00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:19.450
今天是你的幸运日 跟我来
Well, today's your lucky day. Follow me.

196
00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.330
莫汉医生 你有时间吗?
Dr. Mohan, you got a minute?

197
00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.910
有 你见过艾玛吗?
Yeah. Have you met Emma?

198
00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.620
今天是她第一天上班 新毕业的注册护士
First day. New grad RN.

199
00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:27.370
嗨 很高兴认识你
Hi. Nice to meet you.

200
00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.170
艾玛要学习怎么取石膏
Emma needs to learn cast removal.

201
00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:31.880
石膏戴了多久? 几个月 也许几年
How long has the cast been on? Months, maybe years.

202
00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.380
你可能得用嘴呼吸了
Probably gonna want to breathe through your mouth.

203
00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:39.380
好的 狄格比先生
All right, Mr. Digby.

204
00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:42.140
莫汉医生现在来帮你取掉石膏
Dr. Mohan can cut your cast off now.

205
00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.930
你的石膏戴了多久?
How long's the cast been on?

206
00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:46.680
我不知道 但真的很痒
I don't know, but it's really getting itchy.

207
00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:50.150
好的 这玩意是用来切石膏的 不是切皮肤
Okay, this cuts the cast, not the skin.

208
00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.900
这应该能缓解瘙痒
This should relieve the itching.

209
00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:07.330
把石膏撑开器拿过来
Get the cast spreader.

210
00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:15.590
谢谢
Thank you.

211
00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:18.300
好的
Okay.

212
00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:24.720
好了
Okay.

213
00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.560
你还带了些朋友来
Oh, I see you brought some friends.

214
00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.770
天啊 那是... 蛆虫
Oh, my God, are those-Maggots.

215
00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:41.490
我需要氯乙烷喷雾把它们冻掉
I'll need ethyl chloride spray to freeze them off.

216
00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:44.990
在护士学校没见过这种场面吧?
Never saw that in nursing school, am I right?

217
00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.540
现在进行大量冲洗 梅尔
Now irrigate like hell, Mel.

218
00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:54.210
好的
Okay.

219
00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.220
好 我数到三
Okay, on my count.

220
00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:03.090
一 二 三
One, two, three.

221
00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:06.720
快啊 混蛋
Come on, motherfucker.

222
00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.600
肱骨头无法复位
Humeral head is not reducing.

223
00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.810
应该在手术室进行的 我就是手术室
Should be done in the OR. I am the OR.

224
00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:14.310
好了 我们要在骨科回复呼叫前 把它怼回去
Okay, we're gonna get this back in before ortho even answers the page.

225
00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:17.230
梅尔 把四根手指插到肱骨头下面
Mel, stick four fingers under that humeral head.

226
00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:19.230
真的吗? 对 要插得很深
Really? Yeah, get in there really, really deep.

227
00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:23.030
当你感觉到牵引后 把它抬到关节盂上方
And when you feel the traction, lift it above the glenoid.

228
00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.410
这样做会将其转变为前脱位
That will convert this to an anterior dislocation,

229
00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.240
应该能直接复位了
and it should pop right back in.

230
00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:30.450
好的 准备好了吗?
Okay. Ready to go.

231
00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.120
一 二 三
One, two, three.

232
00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:38.210
太棒了
Okay.

233
00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.920
无菌生理盐水敷料
Oh, very cool. Sterile saline dressing.

234
00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.670
肩关节固定带和CT
Shoulder immobilizer and CT.

235
00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:44.800
看来你们不需要我了
Okay. Guess you guys don't need me anymore.

236
00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.810
金医生 你没事吧? 没事
You all right, Dr. King? Yeah.

237
00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:51.730
你看上去似乎有事
You don't seem all right.

238
00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:54.190
我的庭外质询安排在今天
Well, my deposition is today.

239
00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.100
你想聊聊这件事吗?
Do you want to talk about it?

240
00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:58.190
这是禁止的
I'm not allowed to.

241
00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.070
不 我们不一定非得聊庭外质询
No, we don't have to talk about the deposition,

242
00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:03.400
但我们可以聊聊这件事对你的影响
but we can talk about how it is affecting you.

243
00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:06.660
普通急诊医生平均每七年 就会遭遇一起医疗过失诉讼
Average emergency physician catches a med-mal case every seven years.

244
00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.280
十次有九次都是医生赢
Nine times out of ten, the doctor wins.

245
00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.950
我自己就被起诉过四次 阿尔医生你呢?
I've been sued four times myself. Dr. Al?

246
00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:14.710
我从来没有被起诉过
I've never been named in a lawsuit.

247
00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.960
但有时...
But sometime...

248
00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:26.800
格蕾丝修女
Sister Grace.

249
00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:29.800
这是我的住院医生 莫汉医生
This is one of my residents, Dr. Mohan.

250
00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.560
很高兴认识你 我也很高兴认识你
Nice to meet you. You as well.

251
00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:35.890
我希望我们也能招募到 像你们两位这样敬业又有才华的女性
I wish we could recruit as dedicated and talented young women as you two.

252
00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.650
我想那是一种使命 跟治病救人很像
I imagine it's a calling, much like medicine.

253
00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:40.520
是的 非常像
Yes, very much so.

254
00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:44.360
格蕾丝修女 我们在显微镜下
Sister Grace, under the microscope,

255
00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:47.860
看到了一种革兰氏阴性细菌
we're seeing something called a gram-negative bacteria.

256
00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:49.700
很严重吗?
Is that serious?

257
00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.740
如果不治疗的话可能会很严重
It can be if left untreated.

258
00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:54.330
但幸运的是 我们可以给你打一针抗生素
But, fortunately, we can give you a shot of antibiotics,

259
00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:56.040
用一升生理盐水冲洗你的眼睛
irrigate your eye with a liter of saline,

260
00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.460
再开瓶眼药水 让你在家里每隔几小时滴一次
and give you drops to use at home every few hours.

261
00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.790
我是怎么感染的?
How did I get it?

262
00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:08.930
你眼睛里发现的细菌形态显示是淋病
So the appearance of the bacteria in your eye suggests that it's gonorrhea.

263
00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:12.890
一般来说 这是通过性传播... 我知道淋病是什么 贾瓦迪医生
Traditionally, that's a sexually-I know what gonorrhea is, Dr. Javadi.

264
00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.310
我是修女 不是白痴
I'm a nun, not a numbskull.

265
00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:18.640
我经常去一个救助站帮忙
I do a lot of work at an unhoused shelter.

266
00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:23.820
你会接触到脏床单、枕套 和被污染的衣物吗?
Are you handling dirty sheets, pillowcases, soiled clothes?

267
00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:27.990
是的 我每天都要花很多时间洗衣服
Yes. Part of my day is spent doing laundry,

268
00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:31.160
铺床和处理旧衣服
making beds, disposing of old clothes.

269
00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.530
你会戴手套吗?
Do you wear gloves?

270
00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:34.830
如果有的话
When they're available.

271
00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:37.710
好吧 我们先给你打针
Okay. Well, let's get you your shot

272
00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.870
和冲洗眼睛吧
and set up for irrigating your eye.

273
00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.960
我相信我们肯定能趁你住院期间 搜刮出几盒手套的
I bet we can scrounge up a couple boxes of gloves while you're here.

274
00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.380
你必须要保护好自己
It's important to protect yourself.

275
00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.340
我们一会儿回来
We'll be back.

276
00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:50.970
我为什么在这儿?
Why am I here?

277
00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.100
我没生病
I'm not sick.

278
00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:57.480
我们今天早些时候 接诊了你的丈夫伊森
Oh, we took care of your husband, Ethan, earlier today.

279
00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:59.560
伊森生病了吗?
Is Ethan sick?

280
00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:03.150
他病得很重
Well, he was very ill.

281
00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:06.480
我们尝试了一切办法救治他
And we did everything we could to treat him,

282
00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:09.490
但他的心脏还是停止跳动了
but his heart stopped beating.

283
00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:12.990
我很遗憾地通知你 他已经离世了
And I'm so sorry to say that he died.

284
00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.370
他死了?
He died?

285
00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:18.580
伊森?
Ethan?

286
00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:21.460
不
No, no.

287
00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:23.880
你确定吗?
Are you sure?

288
00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:27.510
是的
Yes.

289
00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:32.680
不 伊森没生病
No, no, no, no, no. Ethan isn't sick.

290
00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.890
不
No!

291
00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.470
我知道你一定很难过
I know how difficult this must be for you.

292
00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:48.150
超声显示肾脏没问题 没有腹内伤
Kidneys look good on ultrasound. No intra-abdominal injury.

293
00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.990
嘿 迪伦 罗比
Hey, Dylan. Robby.

294
00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:52.240
这是那个滚下楼梯的孩子凯莉吗?
Is this the "tumble down the stairs" kid--Kylie?

295
00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.700
是的 然后呢?
Yeah. And?

296
00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:56.370
我想先跟那位女友谈谈 避开小女孩
I'd like to talk to the girlfriend first, away from the little girl.

297
00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:57.410
这个可以安排
We can arrange that.

298
00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:00.910
随时向我们通报情况 是的 随时通报
Okay. Keep us informed. Yes, keep us informed.

299
00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:05.040
被遗弃的无名氏婴儿 更多化验结果出来了
More labs are back on our abandoned baby Jane Doe.

300
00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:10.340
目前为止一起正常 但你之前似乎很担心
Everything looks normal so far, but you seemed really concerned earlier.

301
00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.720
她仍然需要导尿取样
She still needs a cathed urine.

302
00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:14.010
也不一定
Or not.

303
00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.810
袋装尿液不可信
You can't trust a bagged urine.

304
00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:20.350
同意 但我们可以避免 导管造成的损伤
Agreed, but we can avoid the trauma of a catheter.

305
00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.640
用膀胱穿刺吗?
With a suprapubic tap?

306
00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:24.520
我可能还留了几手 阿尔-哈希米医生
Oh, I may have a trick or two up my sleeve, Dr. Al-Hashimi.

307
00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:29.990
嘿 普林塞斯 等等
Hey, Princess, hold up.

308
00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:34.150
嗨 你感觉怎么样 威廉先生? 挺好的
Hi. How you feeling, Mr. Williams? Okay.

309
00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.410
马上要进入那个机器 我有点紧张
A little nervous about going in the machine.

310
00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.530
我有点幽闭恐惧症
I can get a tad claustrophobic.

311
00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:42.540
我明白 但我们要送你去做CT 不是核磁共振
Yeah, well, we're sending you for a CT, not an MRI.

312
00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.960
那类似一个敞开的甜甜圈
So it's like a open doughnut.

313
00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.630
那太好了 我喜欢甜甜圈
Oh, good. I like doughnuts.

314
00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:51.050
你来了 我还以为你把我忘了
There you are. Thought you forgot about me.

315
00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.630
没有 我只是去看了下其他病人
Oh, no, I was just with other patients.

316
00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:57.010
那么 你平时有什么娱乐活动?
So what do you do for fun?

317
00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.760
我主要是陪我姐姐做她喜欢的事
I mainly do what my sister likes.

318
00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.680
她喜欢去肯尼伍德乐园和动物园
She loves Kennywood and the zoo.

319
00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.810
不 我是问你
No, what about you?

320
00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:05.810
你喜欢做什么?
What do you like to do?

321
00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:13.400
我以前喜欢去文艺复兴集市
I used to like the Renaissance fair.

322
00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.700
是吗? 是的
Really? Yeah.

323
00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:16.990
不觉得有点中二吗?
Isn't that kind of dorky, though,

324
00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:19.160
大家都装扮成别人
where everybody dresses up like somebody they're not?

325
00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.580
是啊 但这正是乐趣所在
Yeah, but that's the fun, you know?

326
00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.700
你可以成为任何人物和角色
You can be anyone or anything you want.

327
00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:26.960
我有一次装扮成17世纪的法国女人...
I actually had this alter ego that was a 17th-century French woman--

328
00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.670
站住!
Stop!

329
00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:33.260
你没事吧 孩子?
You okay, kid?

330
00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:34.880
脑子嗡嗡的
That was a doozy.

331
00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:37.890
好的 准备好了吗?
Okay, we ready?

332
00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:40.350
已用无菌纱布清洁并擦干
Cleaned and dried with sterile gauze.

333
00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.310
水是凉的吗? 刚从冰箱拿出来
Is that water cold? Right out the fridge.

334
00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.060
好的 杰西 你抬腋下 我抬腿
Okay, Jesse, you can take the armpits. I'm gonna take the legs.

335
00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:47.560
一 二 三 抬
One, two, three, up.

336
00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:49.810
阿尔-哈希米医生 你负责接尿
Dr. Al-Hashimi, you're gonna be our catcher.

337
00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:53.650
萨米拉 你用那块纱布 在耻骨上方区域做环形擦拭
And, Samira, you're gonna do suprapubic circles with that gauze.

338
00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:55.740
凉水能刺激排尿
And the cold should stimulate voiding.

339
00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.860
就算她尿了 也可能会被污染
Even if she pees, it's likely to be contaminated.

340
00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.820
根据《英国医学杂志》并不会
Not according to the "British Medical Journal."

341
00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.530
他们做过“尿尿调查”
They did the wee-search.

342
00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.700
如果白细胞或亚硝酸盐任何一项阳性 我们就导尿
Any leuks or nitrates, and we cath.

343
00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:07.790
阿尔-哈希米医生 接住
Dr. Al-Hashimi, get it.

344
00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.630
我本想邀请你加入垒球队的
I was gonna invite you to join the softball team,

345
00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.340
但现在我要再考虑一下了
but now I'm not so sure.

346
00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:16.010
好了 看起来你已经取到了 不错的中段尿样本
There we go. Looks like you got a good midstream sample.

347
00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:19.260
这是条干净的毯子 好的 什么计划?
Here's a fresh blanket. Okay. Plan.

348
00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:23.060
用头孢曲松 先住两天院 直到血培养结果呈阴性
Ceftriaxone, two-day admit till blood culture is negative.

349
00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:24.220
接下来呢?
Next steps?

350
00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:25.980
寄养机构?
Foster care.

351
00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:33.900
你妈妈一定是陷入了绝境 才会抛弃你 小家伙
Oh, yeah. Someone must have been in a bad way to walk away from you, little one.

352
00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.690
我们需要报警吗?
We need to call the police?

353
00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:39.450
尿检结果出来了告诉我
Let me know what the urine dip shows.

354
00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:44.740
我们会告诉你尿检结果的
We will let you know what the urine dip shows.

355
00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.330
你一定就是阿尔-哈希米医生吧
You must be Dr. Al-Hashimi.

356
00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:51.040
而你一定就是朗登医生了
And you must be Dr. Langdon.

357
00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:54.050
我听说了很多关于你的事 欢迎回来
I've heard all about you. Welcome back.

358
00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:57.260
这位是? 琳达·史蒂文斯
And this is? Linda Stevens.

359
00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:00.300
她心绞痛发作 休息后缓解了
One episode of substernal chest pressure resolved with rest.

360
00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:03.640
12导联心电图未见 ST段抬高型心肌梗死 正前往北区4号
12-lead negative for STEMI. Heading for North 4.

361
00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:06.560
你好 我是阿尔-哈希米医生
Hello, I'm Dr. Al-Hashimi.

362
00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:10.060
很高兴认识你 很高兴认识你
Nice to meet you. Nice to meet you.

363
00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.020
女士 这是一家教学医院
Ma'am, this is a teaching hospital.

364
00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.900
可以让我们的几位实习生 跟我一起吗?
Is it okay if some of our trainees join me?

365
00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:15.820
没问题
Not a problem.

366
00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:19.650
维塔克医生 贾瓦迪 奥吉尔维 乔伊
Dr. Whitaker, Javadi, Ogilvie, Joy...

367
00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.160
都过来
...gather round.

368
00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.370
朗登医生 你也可以留下
Dr. Langdon, you are more than welcome to stay, too.

369
00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:28.080
最多待一会吧 我们分诊挺忙的
Maybe for a minute. We're pretty busy in triage.

370
00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.080
好的
Okay.

371
00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.120
史蒂文斯女士
Ms. Stevens...

372
00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.540
我手机里有一款应用 能记录我们的谈话
...I have an app on my phone that can listen to our conversation

373
00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:37.630
和身体检查的所有细节
and the details of my physical exam

374
00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.840
并将其输入到你的病历中
and write it all up in your medical record.

375
00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.840
哇 太牛了
Wow.

376
00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:44.470
所有信息都将受到保护并严格保密
It's protected, confidential,

377
00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:46.510
甚至不会在我的手机上留存 这意味着...
doesn't even stay on my phone...

378
00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:47.430
怎么了?
What's going on?

379
00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:49.680
某个混蛋嫌犯一看到警察就跑了
Some A-hole perp took off when he saw the cops,

380
00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.140
把她从凳子上撞翻在地
knocked her backwards off a stool.

381
00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:53.480
天啊 头部创伤 没有失去意识
Oh, Jesus. Head trauma, no LOC.

382
00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.900
好的 你得好好检查一下
Okay, you need to get checked out.

383
00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.270
我没事 你没得选
I'm fine.No choice.

384
00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:57.650
这是工伤
It's work-related.

385
00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:00.570
给她找个病房 准备做颅骨钻孔
Let's find her a room and prep for a burr hole.

386
00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:01.490
什么?
What?

387
00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:07.990
我忘记你多爱开玩笑了 坏血病船长
I forgot how much you like to joke, Captain Scurvy.

388
00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:10.450
坏血病船长是谁?
Who the hell's Captain Scurvy?

389
00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.920
那是我们圈内人的梗
It's an inside thing.

390
00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:13.710
肩膀脱位的病人还好吗?
How's our shoulder guy?

391
00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:16.090
像婴儿一样酣睡着
Oh, he slept like a baby.

392
00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:18.800
CT血管造影未见血管损伤
CT angio shows no vascular injury.

393
00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:22.090
你那个滑倒摔伤 且情绪不稳定的病人呢?
What about your slip-and-fall guy with a labile affect?

394
00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:25.720
迈克尔·威廉 他还在做CT
Michael Williams. He's still in the scanner.

395
00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:28.390
他似乎安定下来了 不需要一刻不离地盯着了
He seems to have settled down, so he doesn't need babysitting.

396
00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:29.680
很好 也许他想通了
Good. Maybe he's coming around.

397
00:18:29.680 --> 00:18:31.520
骨科可以带比林斯先生做手术了
Ortho can take Mr. Billings here up for surgery.

398
00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:34.850
且慢 水手 罗宾纳维奇医生
Belay that order, sailor. Dr. Robinavitch.

399
00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:37.020
海斯廷斯护士 你可以叫我罗比
Nurse Hastings. You can call me Robby.

400
00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:39.360
你可以叫我诺艾儿
You can call me Noelle.

401
00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.070
你可以告诉我这是怎么回事
You could just tell me what the hell's going on here.

402
00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.070
这是诺艾儿
This is Noelle.

403
00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:48.780
她是我们的... 床位控制主管 我们见过
She's our...Bed control manager. No, we met.

404
00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:49.950
病例主管 病例主管
Case manager.

405
00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.580
这个人不能留下
And this guy won't be staying.

406
00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.040
他需要手术
Oh, he needs surgery.

407
00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:56.290
他的保险可以报销 西桥纪念医院的费用
Which his insurance will pay for at Westbridge Memorial,

408
00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.380
但我们这里不行
not here.

409
00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.590
等等 所以我们得转院?
Wait, so we have to transfer?

410
00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:01.670
如果他情况稳定的话
If he's stable.

411
00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:03.550
我觉得他算稳定了
I believe that he is.

412
00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.090
往好的一面想 我们能空出一个床位了
Look on the bright side. We're gonna free up a bed,

413
00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:07.090
让病人出院吧
discharge a patient.

414
00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:09.760
对我们来说确实是好事 但对他就不是了
I mean, that's great for us, not so good for him.

415
00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.890
他会在西桥得到很好的照料
He will get great care at Westbridge,

416
00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:14.480
你同意吗 罗比?
don't you agree, Robby?

417
00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:16.020
我确信他会的
I'm sure that he will. Yeah.

418
00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.730
我错过什么了吗?
What am I missing?

419
00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:22.030
艾伦·比林斯还有什么事 是我不知道的吗?
Is there something else happening with Allen Billings that I don't know about?

420
00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:26.450
医疗层面没有 这只是一次简单的保险转院
Not medically. This is just a simple insurance transfer.

421
00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:30.120
好吧
Yeah, okay.

422
00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:35.540
她这是怎么了?
What's that about?

423
00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:37.750
没什么
Nothing.

424
00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:39.840
感觉不像没什么
Didn't feel like nothing.

425
00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.920
麦凯医生有超乎寻常的共情能力
Dr. McKay has a very heightened sense of empathy.

426
00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:42.840
什么意思?
Meaning?

427
00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:44.970
意思是她很擅长察言观色
Meaning she's good at picking up on stuff.

428
00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:48.430
你什么都没说吧? 没有
You didn't say anything, did you? Nope.

429
00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:51.050
我订阅了福斯塔夫的建议
I subscribe to the Falstaff advice.

430
00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:53.350
谨慎比蛮干更重要
Discretion is the better part of valor.

431
00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:57.060
你还是打算今晚走吗? 是的
You still planning on leaving tonight? Yep.

432
00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:01.480
我不明白你为什么不能明早走
I don't understand why you can't leave in the morning.

433
00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:03.820
能失陪一下吗?
Will you excuse me for a second?

434
00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.490
我得趁那个病人跟监护人分开时 跟她聊几句
I got to go talk to a patient while she's separatedfrom her caregiver. Oh, yeah.

435
00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:08.570
这不太合适吧 是不合适
That doesn't sound ideal. It's not ideal.

436
00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:12.490
但我得搞清楚事情真相 我走之前会找你的
I got to figure out what's going on. And I'll find you before I leave.

437
00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.080
好的
Okay.

438
00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:19.130
好吧 不能再这样下去了
Okay, you got to stop this.

439
00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.300
海斯廷斯
Hastings.

440
00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:24.000
伊万斯
Evans.

441
00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:27.090
希望你知道自己在做什么 这话是什么意思?
Hope you know what you're doing. What is that supposed to mean?

442
00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:30.390
我已经是大姑娘了
I'm a big girl.

443
00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:32.720
好吧 大姑娘
Okay, big girl.

444
00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:35.850
我没事
I'm fine.

445
00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:37.600
那很好 跟随我的手指
That's good. Follow my finger.

446
00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:42.230
头有什么感觉? 有一点酸痛
How's the head? It's a little sore.

447
00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.900
身体前倾 让我看看
Lean forward. Let me take a look.

448
00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:48.280
是啊 你会鼓起一个大包
Yeah, you're gonna have a pretty good goose egg.

449
00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:50.620
头疼吗? 一点点
Headache? A little.

450
00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:54.620
我可以给你拿点泰诺 除非你需要一些更强劲的东西
I can get you some Tylenol, unless you need something stronger.

451
00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.660
不用 我对药物很敏感
Oh, no, that's okay. I'm not very drug tolerant.

452
00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.290
你很幸运
Lucky you.

453
00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:03.750
我很高兴你回来了
You know, I'm glad you're back.

454
00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:06.460
谢谢 我也很高兴能回来
Thanks. Yeah, I'm glad to be back.

455
00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:10.680
你知道我为什么离开吗? 你应该去看看我的病人...
You know why I was away? I should see my patient--

456
00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.220
不知道
No, not really.

457
00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:14.260
我听过一些传言
I mean, I heard rumors,

458
00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:16.010
但我很早之前就明白了传言不可信
but I learned a long time ago not to listen.

459
00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.470
我去了康复中心
I was in rehab

460
00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:19.520
为了戒除对安定药物的瘾
for an addiction to benzos.

461
00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:24.270
是的 但我现在已经成功戒断了
Yeah, but I'm clean now,

462
00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:25.980
而且我从未因此影响我的工作
and it never affected my work.

463
00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:30.240
我只是需要一劳永逸地 把它从我身体里清除干净
I just needed to get it all out of my system once and for all.

464
00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:35.780
我之前没有采取正确的处理方式
Yeah, I didn't handle things the way I should have.

465
00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:39.910
我以为可以治好自己 我让很多人失望了
I thought I could treat myself, and I let a lot of people down.

466
00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:42.130
我很抱歉 梅尔
I'm sorry, Mel.

467
00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:45.210
你没有让我失望过
You never let me down.

468
00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.630
我有
Yeah. Yeah, I did.

469
00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:52.760
我应该以身作则 而不是成为反面教材
I should be setting an example, not a cautionary tale.

470
00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:55.100
嘿
Hey.

471
00:21:56.010 --> 00:21:56.930
你还好吗?
How you doing?

472
00:21:57.520 --> 00:21:58.430
我挺好的
I'm okay.

473
00:21:58.430 --> 00:22:00.980
听着 刚才的事我真的很抱歉
Listen, I'm really sorry about all that.

474
00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:03.400
那家伙昨晚抢劫了一家酒类专卖店
The guy robbed a liquor store last night.

475
00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:06.730
他试图骑自行车逃离 但意外摔倒了 然后他就徒步逃跑了
He tried to get away on a bicycle but wiped out and took off on foot.

476
00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:08.070
他肯定是一瘸一拐地走进了这里
He must've hobbled in here,

477
00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:10.690
我想他更多是为了躲藏 而不是缝针
more so to hide out than to get stitched up, I think.

478
00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:12.320
你抓到他了吗? 我们会的
You catch him? We will.

479
00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:14.200
你能提供的任何线索都会有帮助
Anything you could tell us about him will help.

480
00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:16.280
你觉得他会用真实身份吗?
You think he gave legit information?

481
00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:19.080
可能不会 但我们也没别的办法了
Probably not, but it's all we have at the moment.

482
00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:21.330
如果我们找到他
If we do find him,

483
00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:23.370
你可能需要出庭作证 金医生
you may have to testify in court, Dr. King.

484
00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:26.710
出庭? 作为关键证人
"In court"? As a material witness.

485
00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:30.630
就是证明一下 他的伤情和治疗情况 很简单
Attest to his injuries, his treatments...simple stuff.

486
00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:34.010
到时再说吧
Yeah, but we'll cross that bridge when we come to it, right?

487
00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:35.800
梅尔?
Mel?

488
00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:38.890
你好好休息 我马上回来
Rest here a minute. I'll be right back.

489
00:22:42.600 --> 00:22:44.520
我没事 真的 我可以...
You know, I'm fine, really. I should--

490
00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:46.730
就十分钟 拜托了 这是医嘱
Ten minutes, please. Doctor's orders.

491
00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:51.820
急诊科是会有点刺眼和吵闹
ER can be a little bright and noisy.

492
00:22:57.030 --> 00:22:59.080
足背动脉
Dorsalis pedis

493
00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:02.330
和胫后动脉搏动2+ 双侧对称
and posterior tibial pulses 2 plus and equal.

494
00:23:02.910 --> 00:23:04.290
检查结果一切正常 女士
Your exam is perfect, ma'am.

495
00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:06.380
很高兴听到这个消息
Oh, that is good to hear.

496
00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:08.960
你的血检结果出来后 我会再来看你
I will be back when your blood tests are ready.

497
00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:11.000
如果胸痛复发了 立刻告诉我们
Let us know if the chest pain returns.

498
00:23:11.010 --> 00:23:13.010
谢谢 不客气
Thank you. You are so welcome.

499
00:23:15.590 --> 00:23:18.350
你怎么看? 我觉得不是心脏的问题
What do you think? Well, I don't think it's cardiac.

500
00:23:18.350 --> 00:23:20.060
我是说 你对那个应用怎么看?
I mean, what do you think of the app?

501
00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:22.430
没有看到全貌很难说
I mean, it's hard to say without seeing the full thing.

502
00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:23.560
那就看看吧
Take a look.

503
00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:25.600
琳达·史蒂文斯

504
00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:26.690
天啊
Oh, my God.

505
00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:28.690
你知道这能节省多少时间吗?
Do you know how much time this will save?

506
00:23:28.690 --> 00:23:31.360
研究显示 你能节省80%的写病历时间
Studies show you can spend 80% less time charting.

507
00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:33.360
你能更快离开这里
You'll get out of here sooner,

508
00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:35.900
提升病人和医生的满意度
improving both patient and physician satisfaction.

509
00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:39.870
不好意思 这上面说 她在服用利培酮 一种抗精神病药
Oh, excuse me. It says here she takes Risperdal, an antipsychotic.

510
00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:42.410
但她失眠时服用的是替马西泮
She takes Restoril when needed for sleep.

511
00:23:42.410 --> 00:23:44.290
所以这是... 人工智能
So is that... AI,

512
00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:45.920
人工智障
"almost intelligent."

513
00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:49.630
目前生成式人工智能的正确率有98%
Generative AI is 98% accurate at present.

514
00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:52.960
你们必须仔细核查并改正微小错误
You must always carefully proofread and correct the minor errors.

515
00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:55.090
它很优秀 但远不及完美
It's excellent but not perfect.

516
00:23:55.090 --> 00:23:56.840
这简直太棒了
This is amazing.

517
00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:04.720
你会说波斯语? 我本科在加州大学洛杉矶分校念的
You speak Farsi? Oh, I did my undergrad at UCLA.

518
00:24:04.730 --> 00:24:06.180
我有很多波斯同学
A lot of my friends were Persian.

519
00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:07.690
所以你学了波斯语?
So you learned the language?

520
00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:10.190
学了点皮毛 足够破冰了
Enough to break the ice.

521
00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:11.650
你真令我惊讶
I am impressed.

522
00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:14.780
我也很惊讶...
Me too...

523
00:24:15.360 --> 00:24:16.900
你竟然有朋友
that you had friends.

524
00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:19.740
维塔克医生 我见过那个 有阿尔茨海默症的遗孀了
Dr. Whitaker, I said hello to your widow with Alzheimer's,

525
00:24:19.740 --> 00:24:21.320
但她只想跟医生谈
but she only wants to talk to a doctor.

526
00:24:21.330 --> 00:24:23.240
她早都该换纸尿裤了
She's also very overdue for a diaper change.

527
00:24:23.240 --> 00:24:24.660
好的
Okay.

528
00:24:24.660 --> 00:24:27.120
谢谢 奥吉尔维 你跟我来
Yeah, thank you. Ogilvie, you're with me.

529
00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:29.960
走吧
Come on.

530
00:24:31.250 --> 00:24:32.250
博斯蒂克太太?
Mrs. Bostick?

531
00:24:35.420 --> 00:24:37.340
章鱼壶心肌病?心碎综合征? 不是
Takotsubo? Broken heart syndrome? No.

532
00:24:38.680 --> 00:24:39.840
你好?
Hello?

533
00:24:40.430 --> 00:24:43.180
嘿 你想见我?
Hey. You wanted to see me?

534
00:24:43.180 --> 00:24:44.560
才没有
No.

535
00:24:45.060 --> 00:24:46.060
你是谁?
Who are you?

536
00:24:47.310 --> 00:24:51.020
我是维塔克医生 我们聊过你丈夫
I'm Dr. Whitaker. We talked about your husband?

537
00:24:52.980 --> 00:24:53.980
伊森
Oh, Ethan.

538
00:24:55.070 --> 00:24:56.740
能让他来看我吗?
Oh, can he please come see me?

539
00:25:01.740 --> 00:25:02.740
不能
No.

540
00:25:03.580 --> 00:25:06.080
很不幸 他病得很重
Unfortunately, he was very sick,

541
00:25:07.370 --> 00:25:09.330
已经去世了
and he died.

542
00:25:11.830 --> 00:25:15.090
伊森...死了?
Ethan? Died?

543
00:25:16.050 --> 00:25:20.550
不 这不可能
No. No, that's impossible.

544
00:25:21.390 --> 00:25:27.230
不
No.

545
00:25:27.810 --> 00:25:29.310
你有什么爱好吗?
What do you like to do for fun?

546
00:25:29.310 --> 00:25:30.770
我喜欢骑马
I love horseback riding.

547
00:25:30.770 --> 00:25:32.190
你爸爸会带你去吗?
Does your dad take you? Yep.

548
00:25:32.190 --> 00:25:36.690
是的 有时他也会骑 但大多数时候 他都是看着我骑
Sometimes he even rides, but most of the time, he just watches me.

549
00:25:36.690 --> 00:25:38.070
你从马上摔下来过吗?
Have you ever fallen off?

550
00:25:38.070 --> 00:25:39.950
你被甩下来过吗? 没有
Have you ever been thrown? Nope.

551
00:25:40.570 --> 00:25:42.610
我骑术很好
I'm a very good rider.

552
00:25:42.620 --> 00:25:44.740
你有自己的马吗? 要是有就好了
Do you have your own horse? I wish.

553
00:25:44.740 --> 00:25:46.450
我们住在公寓里
We live in an apartment.

554
00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:49.540
好的 凯莉 我们现在要抽一点血
Okay, Kylie, we need to take some blood now.

555
00:25:49.540 --> 00:25:51.040
一定要抽吗?
Do you have to do that?

556
00:25:51.670 --> 00:25:56.840
是的 但我保证我会动作超快 只会疼一下子 好吗?
Yeah, but I promise it'll go super fast and only hurt for, like, a moment, okay?

557
00:25:56.840 --> 00:26:01.300
我现在要把这个皮筋绑在你胳膊上
So I'm just gonna put this rubber band

558
00:26:01.300 --> 00:26:02.890
好让血管看得更清楚
around your arm to help me find your vein better.

559
00:26:03.680 --> 00:26:05.050
然后给你消毒
And then this makes sure no germs

560
00:26:05.050 --> 00:26:08.890
确保在抽血时 不会有细菌进入你的身体
get in your body when we do it.

561
00:26:08.890 --> 00:26:12.310
好了 现在你会感到一点刺痛
Okay, now you're just gonna feel this teeny little prick.

562
00:26:12.310 --> 00:26:13.810
但你可以把头别过去 好吗?
But you can look away, okay?

563
00:26:16.820 --> 00:26:18.230
最糟糕的部分结束了
Worst part's over.

564
00:26:20.990 --> 00:26:21.990
勇敢的小姑娘
Tough little girl.

565
00:26:22.820 --> 00:26:25.870
是啊 小女孩可以跟小男孩一样勇敢
Yeah, well, little girls can be just as tough as little boys,

566
00:26:25.870 --> 00:26:27.370
甚至更勇敢 是的
even tougher. Yes.

567
00:26:27.370 --> 00:26:30.290
我只希望她不是被迫变得这么勇敢的
I just hope it's not because she's become accustomed to pain.

568
00:26:31.120 --> 00:26:33.080
起码要给她做一次外阴检查
At the very least, she's gonna need a visual exam

569
00:26:33.080 --> 00:26:35.380
看是否有创伤迹象
of external genitalia to look for signs of trauma.

570
00:26:35.380 --> 00:26:36.750
我可以让阿尔-哈希米医生...
I can have Dr. Al-Hashimi--

571
00:26:36.750 --> 00:26:39.260
不用 她是我的病人 我来就行
No, she's my patient. I can do it.

572
00:26:47.810 --> 00:26:49.180
干净清澈
Nice and clear.

573
00:26:49.850 --> 00:26:54.480
如果感染了 会变得浑浊
With an infection, it'd be kind of cloudy.

574
00:26:54.480 --> 00:26:57.900
乔伊 我上夹子后 准备插第三个瓶子
Joy, get ready to spike the third bottle here after I clamp.

575
00:26:57.900 --> 00:26:59.860
这边没问题吗? 没问题
All good in here? Yes.

576
00:26:59.860 --> 00:27:02.440
维塔克医生正在解释 自发性细菌性腹膜炎
Dr. Whitaker was just explaining that with SBP,

577
00:27:02.450 --> 00:27:04.700
会导致液体呈浑浊状
we would see a turbid appearance.

578
00:27:04.700 --> 00:27:07.660
然而 他忽略了一点 出现血性腹水有两种可能
However, he failed to mention that bloody fluid indicates either a traumatic tap

579
00:27:07.660 --> 00:27:08.950
要么我们扎到血管了
or the likelihood of hepatocellular carcinoma,

580
00:27:08.950 --> 00:27:11.120
要么很可能是肝癌
in which case, we would send for cytology.

581
00:27:11.120 --> 00:27:13.870
如果是后者 我们要送去做细胞学检查
That is correct.

582
00:27:13.870 --> 00:27:14.960
正确
Kid knows his shit.

583
00:27:15.540 --> 00:27:16.790
这孩子有认真做功课
He's so smart.

584
00:27:16.790 --> 00:27:18.880
他可真是个大聪明

585
00:27:22.840 --> 00:27:24.590
嘿 嘿
Oh, hey. Hey.

586
00:27:24.590 --> 00:27:26.890
正式成为医生是什么感觉?
How's it feel to officially be a doctor?

587
00:27:26.890 --> 00:27:29.010
说实话 感觉挺好的
It's pretty cool, actually.

588
00:27:29.010 --> 00:27:31.010
我今天拿到了第一笔工资
I get my first paycheck today.

589
00:27:31.020 --> 00:27:33.890
只有第一周的 但我接受了
It's only for the first week, but I will take it.

590
00:27:33.890 --> 00:27:35.310
那两个医学生怎么样?
How are the med students?

591
00:27:36.310 --> 00:27:37.770
乔伊挺特立独行的
Joy is pretty peculiar.

592
00:27:37.770 --> 00:27:39.560
另一个 奥吉尔维
And the other guy, Ogilvie,

593
00:27:39.570 --> 00:27:42.860
他很聪明 而且喜欢炫耀
is really smart and likes to show people.

594
00:27:42.860 --> 00:27:44.240
他真的惹人烦
He's obnoxious.

595
00:27:45.490 --> 00:27:47.860
他是你的竞争对手
Well... What he is, is your competition.

596
00:27:47.870 --> 00:27:50.280
他是个野心家 得了吧
He's a gunner. Yeah, right.

597
00:27:54.120 --> 00:27:55.500
他不是我的竞争对手
He's not my competition.

598
00:27:56.080 --> 00:27:58.830
他是从其他州来的 要进行为期四周的实习
He's from out of state for a four-week sub-internship.

599
00:27:58.830 --> 00:28:00.210
你不觉得他在瞄准
You don't think he's angling

600
00:28:00.210 --> 00:28:02.800
明年急诊科住院医师的位置吗?
for an emergency residency spot here next year?

601
00:28:03.460 --> 00:28:04.720
就算是...
I mean, even if he was...

602
00:28:05.680 --> 00:28:06.680
怎样?
What?

603
00:28:06.680 --> 00:28:09.550
他不可能跟你的天才大脑抗衡?
He couldn't possibly compete with your gigantic brain?

604
00:28:14.350 --> 00:28:16.560
如果我是你 我会打起十二分精神 宕机女孩
I'd step it up if I were you, Crash.

605
00:28:19.560 --> 00:28:22.270
她还这么叫你?
Oh, she's still calling you that, huh?

606
00:28:22.270 --> 00:28:24.190
我已经不在乎了
I don't really even care anymore.

607
00:28:24.190 --> 00:28:26.110
她不也叫你哈克贝瑞吗?
I mean, she still calls you Huckleberry.

608
00:28:26.110 --> 00:28:29.240
是啊 但我们现在是朋友了 所以...
Yeah, but, you know, friends now, so...

609
00:28:29.240 --> 00:28:31.660
朋友不会给彼此起烂绰号
Friends don't give each other shitty nicknames.

610
00:28:32.410 --> 00:28:35.040
你觉得“哈克贝瑞”这个绰号很烂吗?
You think Huckleberry is a shitty nickname?

611
00:28:36.830 --> 00:28:39.790
不 “哈克贝瑞”很可爱
No. No, Huckleberry is cute.

612
00:28:41.290 --> 00:28:43.500
挺酷的 不像“宕机女孩”
It's cool. It's not like Crash.

613
00:28:44.340 --> 00:28:46.050
拜托 “宕机女孩”也挺酷的
Oh, come on, man, Crash is pretty cool.

614
00:28:46.050 --> 00:28:48.220
就像 你懂的 突然宕机了
It's, like, you know, Crash.

615
00:28:48.220 --> 00:28:49.760
有股冲劲
It's got momentum.

616
00:28:51.180 --> 00:28:53.010
贾瓦迪医生 维塔克医生
Dr. Javadi, Dr. Whitaker.

617
00:28:53.890 --> 00:28:57.230
我还是实习医生 维塔克现在是真正的医生了
Oh, I'm still a student doctor. Whitaker's the real deal now.

618
00:28:57.230 --> 00:28:58.310
是啊
Right.

619
00:29:00.100 --> 00:29:02.110
欢迎回来 谢谢
Welcome back. Thanks.

620
00:29:02.110 --> 00:29:04.360
谢谢 很高兴能回来
Yeah, thank you. It's good to be back.

621
00:29:06.900 --> 00:29:11.030
好的 我被流放到“分诊岛”了
Okay, I will be in exile on Triage Island

622
00:29:11.030 --> 00:29:13.580
跟其他瘾君子一起 如果有人要找我 就去那儿吧
with the rest of the drug addicts, if anyone needs me.

623
00:29:15.580 --> 00:29:16.870
这太奇怪了 非常奇怪
That was weird. Very.

624
00:29:18.000 --> 00:29:19.410
贾瓦迪的生日派对在哪举办?

625
00:29:19.420 --> 00:29:20.750
暂时还没计划

626
00:29:20.750 --> 00:29:21.710
什么?
What?

627
00:29:21.710 --> 00:29:23.750
那我们就计划一下...

628
00:29:25.550 --> 00:29:27.510
你觉得贾瓦迪看着像21岁吗?

629
00:29:28.300 --> 00:29:32.390
现在像了 这地方催人老

630
00:29:32.390 --> 00:29:34.430
姑娘 拜托

631
00:29:35.970 --> 00:29:36.890
你不老

632
00:29:36.890 --> 00:29:37.980
我也不老

633
00:29:38.390 --> 00:29:40.520
但有些人老了

634
00:29:44.770 --> 00:29:45.940
这一定很疼
That's got to hurt.

635
00:29:45.940 --> 00:29:47.440
朗登医生 克林特·汉森
Dr. Langdon, Clint Hansen,

636
00:29:47.440 --> 00:29:48.650
这是他表妹蒙娜
his cousin Mona.

637
00:29:48.650 --> 00:29:49.740
这是怎么发生的?
How'd this happen?

638
00:29:51.700 --> 00:29:54.820
被煎锅里的培根油溅到了 看着可不止是溅了点油
Bacon grease from a big griddle. Oh, looks like more than a splatter.

639
00:29:54.830 --> 00:29:57.160
某个白痴在我洗碗的时候 把锅直接放进了水槽
Yeah, some fool poured it in the sink while I was washing dishes.

640
00:29:57.160 --> 00:29:58.080
我离得很远
I was so far away.

641
00:29:58.080 --> 00:29:59.910
你看都没看就伸手拿肥皂
You reached for the soap without even looking.

642
00:29:59.910 --> 00:30:02.290
你没听到我说话吗? 没 水龙头开着听不到
You couldn't hear me? No, not with the water running.

643
00:30:02.290 --> 00:30:04.170
谁会把培根油倒进下水道啊?
Who the hell pours bacon grease down the drain?

644
00:30:04.170 --> 00:30:05.420
水槽下面有个罐子
There's a jar under the sink.

645
00:30:05.420 --> 00:30:07.670
你可以早点告诉我 你是我的客人
Well, you could have told me that. You're a guest in my house,

646
00:30:07.670 --> 00:30:09.420
现在你把我的下水道彻底堵死了
and now you've totally fucked up my plumbing.

647
00:30:09.420 --> 00:30:11.050
我们还是专注于治疗烧伤吧
Okay, how about we focus on treating this burn?

648
00:30:11.050 --> 00:30:11.970
我去拿麻醉药
I'll grab the LET.

649
00:30:11.970 --> 00:30:13.890
我们得剪掉一些死皮
We're gonna need to trim off some of the dead skin

650
00:30:13.890 --> 00:30:14.970
防止感染
so it doesn't get infected.

651
00:30:14.970 --> 00:30:17.930
我是负责早午餐自助餐的 你能快点吗?
I'm in charge of the brunch buffet. Can you make it fast?

652
00:30:18.720 --> 00:30:20.390
当然 好的 我们... 这个病人是坐车来的
Sure. Yeah, we-This one came in by car.

653
00:30:20.390 --> 00:30:22.350
我只知道他叫奥兰多·迪亚兹
All I got is a name--Orlando Diaz.

654
00:30:22.350 --> 00:30:24.350
怎么回事? 他被钢筋绊倒了
What's the story? He tripped over some rebar.

655
00:30:24.360 --> 00:30:25.860
是绊倒了还是晕倒了? 不知道
Tripped or fainted? I don't know.

656
00:30:25.860 --> 00:30:28.190
奥兰多 睁开眼睛
Orlando, open your eyes.

657
00:30:28.190 --> 00:30:29.530
他撞到头了吗? 应该是吧
Hit his head? I guess.

658
00:30:29.530 --> 00:30:32.070
你为什么不叫救护车? 他不肯 他当时还能说话
Why didn't you call 911? He wouldn't let me. He was talking--

659
00:30:32.070 --> 00:30:33.450
现在不怎么说了
not so much now.

660
00:30:33.450 --> 00:30:35.370
奥兰多 迪亚兹先生
Orlando. Mr. Diaz.

661
00:30:36.030 --> 00:30:37.490
天哪 他喝醉了?
Jesus. He drunk?

662
00:30:37.490 --> 00:30:39.290
不是 呼气有酮味 他有糖尿病吗?
No. Ketones on his breath. He diabetic?

663
00:30:39.290 --> 00:30:40.250
我不知道
I don't know.

664
00:30:40.250 --> 00:30:42.960
头部创伤 意识状态改变 可能并发糖尿病酮酸中毒 立即急救
Altered head trauma, possible DKA. Call it overhead.

665
00:30:45.880 --> 00:30:48.500
启动一级创伤急救
Code trauma tier one now. Code trauma tier one now.

666
00:30:48.500 --> 00:30:51.630
维塔克医生 你的评估一针见血
Dr. Whitaker, your assessment was spot-on.

667
00:30:51.630 --> 00:30:54.050
你那位患有阿尔茨海默症的遗孀 需要安置到养老院
Your Alzheimer's widow definitely needs placement.

668
00:30:54.050 --> 00:30:56.090
有今天就能接收她的养老院吗?
Do you have a nursing home that can take her today?

669
00:30:56.100 --> 00:30:57.010
我也希望有
I wish.

670
00:30:57.010 --> 00:30:59.600
医保规定 必须住院满三天
Medicare requires a three-day hospitalization

671
00:30:59.600 --> 00:31:00.770
他们才会批准
before they'll approve that.

672
00:31:00.770 --> 00:31:02.810
我没有让她住院的理由
I don't really have a reason to admit her.

673
00:31:02.810 --> 00:31:03.850
但是我有
But I do.

674
00:31:03.850 --> 00:31:05.690
她已经丧失了行为能力
She's gravely disabled.

675
00:31:05.690 --> 00:31:08.230
我会让她坐轮椅 这个方案可行
I'll put her on a cycle. We'll make it work.

676
00:31:08.230 --> 00:31:09.480
谢谢你 卡勒布
Thank you, Caleb.

677
00:31:11.190 --> 00:31:13.150
你有时间吗 迈克尔?
Yeah, you have a few moments, Michael?

678
00:31:13.150 --> 00:31:14.610
我没有
Actually, I do not.

679
00:31:14.610 --> 00:31:17.740
但我这边处理完之后 我会去找你的
But once I get things settled here, I will come and find you.

680
00:31:18.410 --> 00:31:19.410
好的
Okay.

681
00:31:21.910 --> 00:31:22.950
罗比医生
Dr. Robby,

682
00:31:22.960 --> 00:31:24.710
迪伦跟那个女友谈过了 罗比!
Dylan just talked to the girlfriend-Robby!

683
00:31:24.710 --> 00:31:26.790
等会儿再跟我汇报吧 他怎么了?
You'll have to fill me in in a minute. What do you got?

684
00:31:26.790 --> 00:31:28.750
意识状态改变 我判断不了 他是因为意识不清才摔倒的
AMS. I can't tell if he fell 'cause he was altered

685
00:31:28.750 --> 00:31:29.960
还是因为摔倒了意识不清
or he's altered because he fell.

686
00:31:29.960 --> 00:31:31.960
他呼气有酮味 交给我就行了 谢谢
There's ketones on his breath. Okay, I got this. Thank you.

687
00:31:35.680 --> 00:31:37.510
好吧 就剩咱俩了
All right, I guess it's just us.

688
00:31:37.510 --> 00:31:39.100
那个女友是怎么说的?
What did the girlfriend have to say?

689
00:31:39.100 --> 00:31:41.350
吉娜对此显得很困惑和紧张
Well, Gina seems a little confused and on edge by this,

690
00:31:41.350 --> 00:31:43.470
但我并不怀疑虐待跟她有关
but I'm not suspicious about abuse on her part.

691
00:31:43.480 --> 00:31:44.680
那凯莉的父亲呢?
What about Kylie's father?

692
00:31:44.690 --> 00:31:46.480
我是社工 不会读心
Well, I'm a social worker, not a mind reader.

693
00:31:46.480 --> 00:31:47.520
我得跟他谈谈
I need to speak with him.

694
00:31:47.520 --> 00:31:49.190
是啊 他这会儿应该到了的
Yeah, he's supposed to come in.

695
00:31:49.190 --> 00:31:51.270
如果没来 那就是心虚
If he doesn't, looks pretty guilty.

696
00:31:51.280 --> 00:31:53.360
咱们先别急着下结论
Let's not jump to any conclusions just yet.

697
00:31:53.360 --> 00:31:54.490
我没有
I'm not jumping.

698
00:31:54.490 --> 00:31:57.240
我只是想说 如果那家伙不出现
I'm just saying, if this dude doesn't show up,

699
00:31:58.320 --> 00:32:00.120
我会亲自去找他
hell, I'll go find him myself.

700
00:32:01.700 --> 00:32:02.620
开玩笑的
Kidding.

701
00:32:02.620 --> 00:32:04.540
在她父亲来之前 我会先跟凯莉聊聊
I will speak to Kylie before her dad gets here.

702
00:32:05.370 --> 00:32:06.580
如果他会来的话
If he shows up.

703
00:32:07.710 --> 00:32:08.880
是的
Yes.

704
00:32:08.880 --> 00:32:11.460
那绝对是酮味 我们需要测个快速血糖
That's definitely ketones. We need to do an Accu-Check.

705
00:32:11.460 --> 00:32:13.250
我来吧 他心动过速 心率124
I'm on it. He's tachy at 124.

706
00:32:13.260 --> 00:32:16.170
血氧饱和度97 高压106 低压72
Pulse ox 97. BP's 106/72.

707
00:32:16.180 --> 00:32:18.800
双侧肺滑动正常 肠鸣音良好
Lung sliding bilaterally. Good bowel sounds.

708
00:32:18.800 --> 00:32:21.810
腹部柔软无压痛 你怎么知道无压痛?
Abdomen is soft, non-tender. How do you know it's non-tender?

709
00:32:23.100 --> 00:32:25.020
因为我没看到他呲牙咧嘴
Because I didn't see any grimacing.

710
00:32:25.020 --> 00:32:27.230
他没意识了 扎静脉针他都不会皱眉头的
He's altered. He didn't even flinch for the IV start.

711
00:32:27.850 --> 00:32:28.900
我是想说无僵硬
I meant to say non-rigid.

712
00:32:30.690 --> 00:32:33.860
双侧脚趾向下弯曲 无证据表明上运动神经元受损
Toes down, going bilaterally, no evidence of upper motor neuron deficit.

713
00:32:33.860 --> 00:32:35.940
很好 床旁超声阴性
Good. E-FAST negative.

714
00:32:35.950 --> 00:32:37.110
需要我帮忙吗?
How can I assist?

715
00:32:37.110 --> 00:32:39.990
你可以去看看麦凯医生 或是桑托斯医生
You can check in with Dr. McKay or Dr. Santos.

716
00:32:39.990 --> 00:32:42.740
如果你不介意的话 我想旁观 了解一下你是如何工作的
If you don't mind, I'd like to observe, learn how you handle things.

717
00:32:42.740 --> 00:32:45.040
血糖值很高 超过500了
Blood sugar's critical high-it's over 500.

718
00:32:45.040 --> 00:32:47.750
警铃大作 听上去像是糖尿病酮症酸中毒
Ding, ding, ding, ding. Sounds like diabetic ketoacidosis.

719
00:32:47.750 --> 00:32:49.080
我们必须马上治疗
We need to start treating that,

720
00:32:49.080 --> 00:32:51.420
然后做CT排除颅内出血
then right to CT to rule out an intracranial bleed.

721
00:32:51.420 --> 00:32:53.800
有一个严重呼吸窘迫患者 预计三分钟后到达
Severe respiratory distress coming in. ETA three minutes.

722
00:32:53.800 --> 00:32:55.340
我把他们安排到创伤一室 好的
I'll stick them in Trauma 1. Yep.

723
00:32:55.340 --> 00:32:57.920
你想让我接手吗? 太好了 谢谢
Would you like me to take that? Yes, please. Thank you.

724
00:32:57.930 --> 00:32:59.680
他需要胰岛素滴注 对吧?
This guy needs an insulin drip, right?

725
00:32:59.680 --> 00:33:00.840
每公斤体重0.1单位?
0.1 units per kilo?

726
00:33:00.840 --> 00:33:03.430
不 得先查过血钾
No, not without knowing his potassium.

727
00:33:03.430 --> 00:33:05.310
胰岛素会导致钾向细胞内转移
Insulin causes an intracellular shift.

728
00:33:05.310 --> 00:33:07.730
如果血钾浓度低于3.5 滴注会害死他的
And if the potassium is under 3.5, the drip would kill him.

729
00:33:07.730 --> 00:33:08.890
完全正确
That is very true.

730
00:33:08.890 --> 00:33:10.730
我们可以从乳酸林格液开始
We can start with lactated ringers.

731
00:33:10.730 --> 00:33:12.440
以每小时一升的速度输注 直到我们拿到
1 liter per hour until we get the results

732
00:33:12.440 --> 00:33:14.110
生化七项和静脉血气的结果
from the chem-7 and the VBG.

733
00:33:14.110 --> 00:33:15.150
他为什么会出现糖尿病酮症酸中毒?
Why is he in DKA?

734
00:33:15.150 --> 00:33:16.860
也许他没注射足够的胰岛素
Maybe he's not taking enough insulin.

735
00:33:16.860 --> 00:33:19.400
更常见的情况是有诱发事件
More frequently, a precipitating event can be identified,

736
00:33:19.410 --> 00:33:21.530
比如肺炎、尿路感染、中风
such as pneumonia, urinary tract infection, stroke,

737
00:33:21.530 --> 00:33:23.070
心肌梗死或胰腺炎
myocardial infarction, pancreatitis.

738
00:33:23.080 --> 00:33:26.160
是的 我们都会查的 这是标准流程
Yeah, we always check for those.

739
00:33:26.160 --> 00:33:28.330
对吧 莫汉医生?
They're part of the standard order set, right, Dr. Mohan?

740
00:33:36.210 --> 00:33:37.710
他是疯癫的吉米爷爷那一支的
He's from crazy Grandpa Jimmy's side.

741
00:33:37.720 --> 00:33:39.720
她是我爷爷的弟弟那一支的
She's from my grandfather's brother's side.

742
00:33:39.720 --> 00:33:41.470
里奇叔祖父也是个神经病
Grandpa Ricky is still a psycho.

743
00:33:42.090 --> 00:33:44.430
这显然是家族遗传 等等
Clearly runs in the family. Well, hold on.

744
00:33:44.430 --> 00:33:46.930
你的祖父是里奇和吉米·汉森?
Your grandparents are Ricky and Jimmy Hansen?

745
00:33:47.600 --> 00:33:48.680
那个赛车家族?
From the racing family?

746
00:33:49.390 --> 00:33:50.690
很不幸 是的
Unfortunately.

747
00:33:50.690 --> 00:33:52.350
有件事需要你处理一下
I got something that needs attention.

748
00:33:52.940 --> 00:33:53.940
不会又是个婴儿吧
Not another baby.

749
00:33:56.690 --> 00:33:57.860
抱歉 失陪一下
Sorry. Excuse me.

750
00:34:00.950 --> 00:34:02.740
这是兰德尔先生
This is Mr. Randall.

751
00:34:02.740 --> 00:34:05.410
他已经勃起了八个小时
He's been erect for the last eight hours.

752
00:34:05.410 --> 00:34:07.040
应该早就软下来了 对吧?
Should have gone down by now, right?

753
00:34:07.040 --> 00:34:10.000
这种情况时有发生 你回来是明智的选择 兰德尔先生
It happens. It's a good thing you came in, Mr. Randall.

754
00:34:10.000 --> 00:34:11.040
我马上给他办理入院
I'll take him right back.

755
00:34:11.040 --> 00:34:12.790
你能劝劝那对斗嘴的表亲吗?
Do you mind finishing up with the Bickersons?

756
00:34:12.790 --> 00:34:13.880
还是不了吧
I'd rather not.

757
00:34:14.590 --> 00:34:17.170
那么 兰德尔先生... 叫我伊恩吧
So, Mr. Randall-Ian.

758
00:34:17.170 --> 00:34:21.300
伊恩 你是吃了什么东西 导致这种状况的吗?
Ian, did you take anything that might have led to this condition?

759
00:34:21.300 --> 00:34:23.260
我注射了一支勃起功能障碍药剂
I used an ED injection--two, actually.

760
00:34:23.260 --> 00:34:24.340
其实是两支
I gave myself a second shot,

761
00:34:24.340 --> 00:34:28.390
我又给自己打了一针 一边一针
one on each side.

762
00:34:28.390 --> 00:34:31.100
所以 你用了双倍的推荐剂量?
So double the recommended dosage?

763
00:34:33.350 --> 00:34:35.650
那是我们的结婚纪念日
It's our wedding anniversary.

764
00:34:35.650 --> 00:34:36.980
很重要吗?
Is this a big one?

765
00:34:38.730 --> 00:34:40.320
我是说纪念日 很重要吗?
The anniversary, is it important?

766
00:34:40.320 --> 00:34:42.900
有什么特殊意义吗? 比如 里程碑式的...
Like, significant? Like, a milestone or--

767
00:34:42.910 --> 00:34:44.240
那是我们的二十年结婚纪念日
It's our 20th. Oh, nice.

768
00:34:44.240 --> 00:34:46.450
真好 恭喜
Well done. Congratulations.

769
00:34:47.990 --> 00:34:51.160
血糖 521 血钠 129
Glucose 521. Sodium 129.

770
00:34:51.160 --> 00:34:54.370
血钾 3.7 氯 97
Potassium's 3.7. Chloride's 97.

771
00:34:54.370 --> 00:34:56.210
碳酸氢盐 8 这代表什么?
Bicarb's 8. Meaning?

772
00:34:56.210 --> 00:34:59.590
我们可以开始胰岛素滴注 并在每升液体中加入20单位的钾
We can start the insulin drip and add 20 of K to each liter.

773
00:34:59.590 --> 00:35:02.970
阴离子间隙高达24 它应该小于10的
Big anion gap of 24. It should be under 10.

774
00:35:02.970 --> 00:35:04.760
我们通过监测这个指标 来评估病情发展
We follow it to assess progress.

775
00:35:04.760 --> 00:35:07.550
其实 2024国际指南中指出
Actually, the 2024 international guidelines

776
00:35:07.550 --> 00:35:10.470
不应以阴离子间隙作为判断依据
state that anion gaps should not be used, as they can be misleading

777
00:35:10.470 --> 00:35:13.230
因为在合并高氯性代谢性酸中毒时 它可能产生误导
in the presence of hyperchloremic metabolic acidosis.

778
00:35:15.270 --> 00:35:17.110
我最近接诊了一个重症监护室病例
I recently had a case in the ICU.

779
00:35:17.110 --> 00:35:19.570
静脉血气结果出来了 pH值6.97
VBG is back--pH of 6.97.

780
00:35:19.570 --> 00:35:20.860
正常是7.4
Normal's 7.4.

781
00:35:20.860 --> 00:35:22.440
是什么导致了酸血症?
What causes the acidemia?

782
00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:24.150
没有胰岛素 身体就无法利用葡萄糖
Without insulin, the body can't use glucose,

783
00:35:24.150 --> 00:35:25.700
于是它分解脂肪产生酮体
so it breaks down fat-producing ketones,

784
00:35:25.700 --> 00:35:28.530
导致严重酸中毒 而这可能引发心脏骤停
leading to severe acidosis, which can cause cardiac arrest.

785
00:35:28.530 --> 00:35:31.740
但高血糖会导致身体 排出更多的水分和电解质
But the hyperglycemia causes the body to excrete more water and electrolytes,

786
00:35:31.750 --> 00:35:34.460
从而引起严重脱水 心脏和肾功能障碍
leading to severe dehydration, cardiac and renal dysfunction.

787
00:35:34.460 --> 00:35:38.170
胰岛素滴注 含钾补液 每小时测一次指尖血糖
Insulin drip, fluids with KCL, capillary glucose every hour,

788
00:35:38.170 --> 00:35:39.290
每四小时查一次生化七项
chem-7 every four hours.

789
00:35:39.290 --> 00:35:41.130
重症监护室那边 会要求放一根双腔中线导管
ICU is gonna want a double lumen midline, too.

790
00:35:41.130 --> 00:35:42.260
我可以 我可以
I can do it. I can do it.

791
00:35:42.260 --> 00:35:43.380
6号半手套 7号半手套
6 1/2 gloves. 7 1/2 gloves.

792
00:35:43.380 --> 00:35:46.840
我想说一下 我们评价学生 不仅基于他们的知识储备
Can I just say, we evaluate our students not only on their fund of knowledge

793
00:35:46.840 --> 00:35:48.180
和操作技能
and on their procedural mastery

794
00:35:48.180 --> 00:35:51.310
但更重要的是 我们会考察他们的团队协作能力
but, also, maybe more importantly, on their skills as team players?

795
00:35:52.220 --> 00:35:53.730
他可以 她可以
He can do it. She can do it.

796
00:35:55.270 --> 00:35:56.600
奥特罗 你能给大家介绍一下情况吗?
Otero, will you update everyone?

797
00:35:56.600 --> 00:35:58.940
巴瑞·米歇尔 在帕梅拉餐厅吃早饭
Barry Mitchell. Eating breakfast at Pamela's.

798
00:35:58.940 --> 00:36:00.940
突发呼吸窘迫
Sudden onset respiratory distress.

799
00:36:00.940 --> 00:36:03.150
有喘鸣音 血氧饱和度尚可 但说话困难
Some stridor. Decent pulse ox but trouble speaking.

800
00:36:03.150 --> 00:36:05.280
他们试过海姆立克急救法吗? 三次
And they tried the Heimlich? Three times.

801
00:36:07.160 --> 00:36:08.450
有哮喘病史吗?
Any history of asthma?

802
00:36:10.660 --> 00:36:12.410
准备插管 同意
Set up for intubation. Agreed.

803
00:36:13.040 --> 00:36:14.500
好的 先生 请挪过来
Okay, sir, scoot across.

804
00:36:15.210 --> 00:36:17.830
他们能自己挪到床上 就是个好兆头
Always a good sign when they slide over on their own.

805
00:36:17.830 --> 00:36:20.500
他从餐厅来的 上气道梗阻
Came from a diner with an upper-airway obstruction.

806
00:36:20.500 --> 00:36:23.500
海姆立克法没起效 我们得检查下
Didn't clear with abdominal thrusts. We got to take a look.

807
00:36:23.510 --> 00:36:25.760
心率118 血氧饱和度96
Heart rate's 118. Pulse ox 96.

808
00:36:25.760 --> 00:36:29.260
米歇尔先生 我们要给你镇静 然后看一下你喉咙里面 好吗?
Mr. Mitchell, we're gonna sedate you to look down your throat, okay?

809
00:36:29.260 --> 00:36:30.970
抽取氯胺酮和罗库溴铵
Draw up ketamine and rocuronium.

810
00:36:30.970 --> 00:36:33.260
只用氯胺酮怎么样?
What about ketamine only?

811
00:36:33.270 --> 00:36:37.190
不行 我们需要肌肉完全松弛 来确保首次插管成功
No, we need full paralysis for a successful first-pass intubation.

812
00:36:37.190 --> 00:36:39.900
如果只是个异物 可能根本不用插管
Might not need an intubation if it's just a foreign body.

813
00:36:39.900 --> 00:36:41.020
我们不能做这个假设
We can't assume that.

814
00:36:41.020 --> 00:36:43.520
有可能是声门下狭窄 或者会厌炎
It could be subglottic stenosis, epiglottitis.

815
00:36:43.530 --> 00:36:45.240
氯胺酮和罗库溴铵都准备好了
I got ketamine and roc.

816
00:36:47.450 --> 00:36:48.990
只用氯胺酮 80毫克
Ketamine only, 80 milligrams.

817
00:36:50.280 --> 00:36:52.910
既然如此 就交给你这位大能人全权处理了
In that case, I'll leave this in your capable hands.

818
00:36:54.790 --> 00:36:57.250
西他卡因喷雾和杨克氏吸痰管 谢谢
Cetacaine spray and a Yankauer, please.

819
00:36:58.500 --> 00:37:00.540
半小时前 我告诉过你我从没被投诉过
30 minutes ago, I told you I'd never been sued.

820
00:37:00.540 --> 00:37:01.790
我希望能继续保持下去
I'd like to keep it that way.

821
00:37:05.840 --> 00:37:07.090
八小时屹立不倒
Instead of showing up here,

822
00:37:07.090 --> 00:37:10.300
还以为他会好好利用一下 没想到跑这儿来了
you'd think he'd put an eight-hour hard-on to good use.

823
00:37:10.300 --> 00:37:11.890
这确实是医疗紧急情况
Well, it is a medical emergency.

824
00:37:11.890 --> 00:37:14.430
如果放任不管 异常勃起可能会导致
If left untreated, priapism can cause

825
00:37:14.430 --> 00:37:17.850
永久性阴茎损伤和终生勃起功能障碍
permanent damage to the penis and erectile dysfunction forever.

826
00:37:17.850 --> 00:37:19.520
感谢你插播的公益广告
Thanks for the PSA.

827
00:37:19.520 --> 00:37:23.690
药剂师配好了去氧肾上腺素 每毫升100微克 共10毫升
Pharmacist mixed up phenylephrine. 10 cc's of 100 mikes per cc.

828
00:37:23.690 --> 00:37:25.230
好极了 这是最大剂量
Great. That's the maximum dose.

829
00:37:25.230 --> 00:37:26.320
单剂量无菌生理盐水
Sterile bolus saline.

830
00:37:26.320 --> 00:37:29.320
你可能需要多备点 因为她们会反复冲洗
You might need to refill since they'll be flushing over and over again.

831
00:37:29.320 --> 00:37:31.910
拿一个空盆 接住他吐出来的任何东西
Hold out the empty basin to catch whatever they pull out.

832
00:37:31.910 --> 00:37:34.240
听明白了吗? 我想是的
Got it? I think so.

833
00:37:34.240 --> 00:37:35.910
如果有需要就喊我
Holler if you need me.

834
00:37:35.910 --> 00:37:38.290
这边情况如何? 他注射了咪达唑仑 已经没意识了
How we doing? Oh, he's out from Versed.

835
00:37:38.290 --> 00:37:41.790
在10点和2点钟方向 给阴茎背神经做了利多卡因阻滞
Did a lidocaine block to the dorsal penile nerves at 10 and 2.

836
00:37:41.790 --> 00:37:43.840
是的 他准备好了 很好
Yeah, he's ready. Excellent.

837
00:37:44.840 --> 00:37:48.050
从背面进针 刺入海绵体
Enter the dorsal side to hit the corpus cavernosum.

838
00:37:48.050 --> 00:37:48.970
我来固定龟头
I'll hold the glans.

839
00:37:49.550 --> 00:37:50.880
扎多深? 两公分
How deep? 2 centimeters.

840
00:37:52.340 --> 00:37:53.800
可以抽了
Now aspirate.

841
00:37:56.890 --> 00:37:59.020
你们每天都干这种事吗?
You guys do this, like, every day?

842
00:38:00.770 --> 00:38:01.850
如果走运的话
If we're lucky.

843
00:38:06.730 --> 00:38:08.990
好了 我们让他平躺 看一下到底是什么东西
Okay, let's lay him down and take a look.

844
00:38:10.490 --> 00:38:11.490
好的
Okay.

845
00:38:18.500 --> 00:38:21.120
会厌视野清晰
Good view of the epiglottis.

846
00:38:21.120 --> 00:38:24.170
谜团解开了
And mystery solved.

847
00:38:24.840 --> 00:38:27.550
这就是早饭吃西兰花的后果
This is what you get for eating broccoli for breakfast.

848
00:38:27.550 --> 00:38:28.760
把它夹出来
Get a good grip on it.

849
00:38:29.590 --> 00:38:30.590
好的
Okay.

850
00:38:32.720 --> 00:38:33.720
好的
Okay.

851
00:38:39.770 --> 00:38:42.440
我知道为什么海姆立克法没用了
I can see why the Heimlich didn't work.

852
00:38:43.150 --> 00:38:44.440
转一转
Rotate a little bit.

853
00:38:47.940 --> 00:38:48.940
成功!
Voilà!

854
00:38:50.110 --> 00:38:52.780
这就是为何仅用氯胺酮即可
That is why you give ketamine alone,

855
00:38:52.780 --> 00:38:54.450
因为如果用了肌肉松弛药
because if we gave a paralytic,

856
00:38:54.450 --> 00:38:56.740
就必须给他插管 并且上一小时的呼吸机
we would have to intubate and ventilate for an hour.

857
00:38:58.910 --> 00:39:01.950
好了 这位病人要转院至西桥做手术
All right, this guy is going to Westbridge for surgery.

858
00:39:01.960 --> 00:39:04.370
创伤一室很快就空出来了
Trauma 1 will move out shortly.

859
00:39:04.370 --> 00:39:08.750
阿尔茨海默症遗孀艾芙琳·博斯蒂克 可以去观察室看她丈夫了
And our Alzheimer's widow, Evelyn Bostick, can see her husband in the viewing room.

860
00:39:08.750 --> 00:39:09.840
上帝保佑她
God bless her.

861
00:39:10.420 --> 00:39:12.420
迈克尔·威廉的CT结果出来了吗?
My CT results back on Michael Williams?

862
00:39:12.420 --> 00:39:14.630
还没 凯莉的化验结果也没有
Not yet. Neither are the labs on our little girl, Kylie.

863
00:39:14.630 --> 00:39:15.590
那不是我的病人
That's not me.

864
00:39:15.590 --> 00:39:18.970
不过被遗弃的无名氏宝宝 倒是出了一些结果
I did, however, get a few things back on our abandoned baby Jane Doe.

865
00:39:19.640 --> 00:39:20.470
这也不是我的病人
Still not me.

866
00:39:20.470 --> 00:39:21.560
给我吧
I'll take those.

867
00:39:22.270 --> 00:39:23.600
一有消息我们会通知你
Just keeping you informed.

868
00:39:24.730 --> 00:39:25.650
好的
Yep.

869
00:39:26.560 --> 00:39:27.560
好吧
Okay.

870
00:39:28.690 --> 00:39:30.320
我们只是想把她转移到楼上
We're just trying to get her upstairs.

871
00:39:32.280 --> 00:39:34.360
好吧 知道了
Okay. All right, got it.

872
00:39:34.360 --> 00:39:37.620
超级宝宝的尿检结果出来了 白细胞阴性
Superbaby's urine dipped negative 0 WBCs.

873
00:39:37.620 --> 00:39:39.700
呼吸道病原体检测显示鼻病毒阳性
Respiratory panel is positive for rhinovirus,

874
00:39:39.700 --> 00:39:42.660
说明是良性诱因 降钙素原和C反应蛋白结果还没出来
giving us a benign source. Procalcitonin and CRP are pending.

875
00:39:42.660 --> 00:39:44.750
儿科说他们需要先做尿液毒物筛查
Now Pedes is saying they want a urine tox screen

876
00:39:44.750 --> 00:39:46.750
和HIV抗原检测 才愿意接收她
and an HIV antigen before they'll take her.

877
00:39:46.750 --> 00:39:47.830
有点多余了吧
That sounds excessive.

878
00:39:48.840 --> 00:39:50.880
我感觉他们只是想把她留在急诊
I feel like they're just trying to keep her down here.

879
00:39:50.880 --> 00:39:52.300
这能怪他们吗?
Can you blame them?

880
00:39:52.300 --> 00:39:54.630
我就没见过正常的儿科护士
Never met a Pedes nurse yet that wasn't a little wacky.

881
00:39:54.630 --> 00:39:57.890
你知道连续12小时听婴儿哭 会对一个人造成多大精神伤害吗?
You know what 12 hours of crying babies does to a person's psyche?

882
00:39:57.890 --> 00:40:00.220
我差点去了儿科 万幸你没有 相信我
I almost went into Pedes. Good thing you didn't, trust me.

883
00:40:00.220 --> 00:40:02.520
在那儿待久了 你都能得失心疯
Too long up there, you're cuckoo for Cocoa Puffs.

884
00:40:02.520 --> 00:40:04.230
你今天很犀利啊
You are very punchy today.

885
00:40:04.230 --> 00:40:05.680
犀利是我的新基线
Punchy's my new baseline.

886
00:40:05.690 --> 00:40:07.940
谁敢不怀好意地看我 我就把他揍趴下
Anyone even looks at me funny, I'm taking them out,

887
00:40:07.940 --> 00:40:09.400
直插双眼
going right for the eyes.

888
00:40:09.400 --> 00:40:10.560
我会戳瞎你眼睛
I'll eye-gouge you.

889
00:40:10.570 --> 00:40:12.860
你肯定不知道我有这一面吧 不知道
Bet you never knew that about me. I did not.

890
00:40:12.860 --> 00:40:14.110
阿尔-哈希米医生哪去了?
Where is Dr. Al-Hashimi?

891
00:40:14.110 --> 00:40:17.280
去北区5号看异常勃起的患者了 她比我合适
In North 5 with the priapism. Better her than me.

892
00:40:17.950 --> 00:40:22.080
我没有任何性暗示的意思
I did not intend for that to come off as sexual in any way.

893
00:40:22.080 --> 00:40:23.950
好了 我要去看看路易
And on that note, I'm gonna go check on Louie,

894
00:40:23.950 --> 00:40:25.830
然后去救护车停靠区透透气
and then I'm gonna get some air in the ambulance bay.

895
00:40:25.830 --> 00:40:27.580
所以有人需要我 去那儿找我
So, if anybody needs me, that's where I'll be.

896
00:40:27.580 --> 00:40:28.670
明白 船长
Got it, Cap.

897
00:40:32.170 --> 00:40:34.670
看起来侧切牙根部有脓肿
It looks like some pus at the base of the lateral incisor.

898
00:40:34.670 --> 00:40:35.880
我们可以切开 把脓引出来
We can drain that for you.

899
00:40:37.050 --> 00:40:39.550
感觉挺疼的 不会 我们给你上麻药
Sounds like it's gonna hurt. No, we'll numb you up.

900
00:40:40.220 --> 00:40:42.720
要用好麻药
Make sure you use the good stuff.

901
00:40:43.310 --> 00:40:45.180
我会给你用最好的 路易 我保证
It'll be top shelf, Louie, I promise.

902
00:40:45.810 --> 00:40:46.640
这边怎么样?
How we doing in here? Good.

903
00:40:47.560 --> 00:40:49.980
挺好的 快引出来四升了
Almost 4 liters out.

904
00:40:49.980 --> 00:40:52.770
我已经感觉好多了
I already feel like a million bucks.

905
00:40:52.770 --> 00:40:55.030
我只是需要换个机油
I just needed an oil change.

906
00:40:55.030 --> 00:40:57.360
我马上就要切开引流一个根尖脓肿了
And I'm just about to drain an apical abscess.

907
00:40:57.360 --> 00:40:59.320
这就对了嘛
That's what I'm talking about.

908
00:40:59.320 --> 00:41:01.700
我感觉像在做水疗
I feel like I'm having a spa day.

909
00:41:03.580 --> 00:41:04.660
继续加油 维塔克
Keep it up, Whitaker.

910
00:41:08.500 --> 00:41:10.290
这要多久?
How long does this take?

911
00:41:10.290 --> 00:41:12.250
一小时 有时要两小时
Up to an hour, sometimes two.

912
00:41:13.420 --> 00:41:14.590
梅尔 有什么建议吗?
Mel, any suggestions?

913
00:41:16.210 --> 00:41:17.550
评估你的疼痛等级

914
00:41:17.550 --> 00:41:20.050
梅尔 你在退伍军人医疗中心 做过这些
Mel, you did these at the VA.

915
00:41:20.050 --> 00:41:21.930
我们要如何让勃起消退?
How can we facilitate detumescence?

916
00:41:23.010 --> 00:41:25.930
有时按摩阴茎体可能会有帮助
Oh, sometimes massaging the shaft can help.

917
00:41:25.930 --> 00:41:27.730
这都什么虎狼之词啊
Oh, that's what she said.

918
00:41:27.730 --> 00:41:31.730
你可以通过按摩或挤压来清除血栓
You can break up the clots with massage or compression.

919
00:41:31.730 --> 00:41:32.860
懂了
Got it.

920
00:41:33.690 --> 00:41:34.690
你还好吗 梅尔?
You okay, Mel?

921
00:41:34.690 --> 00:41:37.150
她在担心她的庭外质询
She's thinking about her deposition.

922
00:41:38.490 --> 00:41:41.610
只要坚持陈述事实 一切都会迎刃而解的
Just stick with the facts of the case, and it always goes well.

923
00:41:41.620 --> 00:41:43.200
你不是说你没被起诉过吗?
I thought you said you hadn't been sued.

924
00:41:43.200 --> 00:41:45.910
我是没有 但我的很多同事有过
I haven't, but I know many colleagues who have.

925
00:41:46.580 --> 00:41:48.660
我对你的工作也有所了解 金医生
I also know your work, Dr. King.

926
00:41:49.330 --> 00:41:52.670
你病历中的医疗决策部分 一直都记录得十分详尽
Your medical decision-making in the chart is always extremely thorough.

927
00:41:52.670 --> 00:41:54.590
总算是看到希望了
Now we're getting somewhere.

928
00:41:54.590 --> 00:41:56.920
出现疲软的迹象了
First signs of flaccidity.

929
00:42:00.720 --> 00:42:02.340
我真不知道该怎么感谢你
I don't know how I could ever thank you.

930
00:42:02.340 --> 00:42:04.550
我想你已经感谢过了
Well, I think you just did.

931
00:42:04.550 --> 00:42:05.850
你救了我的命
You saved my life.

932
00:42:07.100 --> 00:42:08.180
我什么都没做
I didn't do anything.

933
00:42:08.930 --> 00:42:12.230
这就是你老婆开始像纳粹一样 管控你饮食的下场
This is what happens when your wife starts being a Nazi about your diet.

934
00:42:12.810 --> 00:42:14.730
她居然让我写进食日记
She's got me keeping a food journal.

935
00:42:14.730 --> 00:42:16.690
这是计算卡路里的好办法
It's a good way to count calories.

936
00:42:16.690 --> 00:42:17.940
什么卡路里?
What calories?

937
00:42:18.570 --> 00:42:21.450
她坚持让我每天吃五份蔬菜
She insists I eat five servings of vegetables a day.

938
00:42:21.450 --> 00:42:23.740
兔子都吃不了那么多
A rabbit don't even eat that many vegetables.

939
00:42:23.740 --> 00:42:26.200
我吃猪柳蛋麦满分可从来没噎着过
I ain't never choked on a Sausage Egg McMuffin.

940
00:42:27.330 --> 00:42:29.540
我感觉在这儿待了一整天了
I feel like I've been here all day.

941
00:42:29.540 --> 00:42:33.330
其实你只待了几小时 博斯蒂克太太
It's actually only been a couple of hours, Mrs. Bostick.

942
00:42:33.330 --> 00:42:34.960
我们现在去哪?
Well, where are we going now?

943
00:42:37.380 --> 00:42:41.380
我觉得你可能会想去看看你丈夫
I thought you might like to see your husband.

944
00:42:42.760 --> 00:42:44.260
伊森还在这儿吗?
Is Ethan still here?

945
00:42:46.050 --> 00:42:47.350
是的
Yeah.

946
00:42:47.350 --> 00:42:48.680
好啊
Yes, yes, please.

947
00:42:57.730 --> 00:43:00.280
真是漫长的一天
This has been such a long day.

948
00:43:01.320 --> 00:43:03.530
我很高兴你终于能休息一会了
I'm so glad to see you resting,

949
00:43:04.450 --> 00:43:08.370
但我想时间差不多了 我们该回家了
but I think it's time. We should be going home.

950
00:43:09.330 --> 00:43:11.330
我们回去时可以顺路去一趟商店
If we stop at the store on the way,

951
00:43:11.330 --> 00:43:14.160
我可以去买你做牧羊人派的食材
I can pick up what I need to make your shepherd's pie.

952
00:43:14.170 --> 00:43:15.830
但如果天气很热就算了
But not if it's hot out.

953
00:43:16.710 --> 00:43:19.050
你知道我讨厌在大热天用烤箱
You know how I hate using the oven in the heat.

954
00:43:21.590 --> 00:43:23.220
我们准备好离开了
We're ready to leave now.

955
00:43:31.100 --> 00:43:33.350
罗比医生 现在方便吗?
Dr. Robby, is this a good time?

956
00:43:33.350 --> 00:43:36.100
这要看你想说什么了 阿尔-哈希米医生
That depends on what you have in mind, Dr. Al-Hashimi.

957
00:43:36.980 --> 00:43:40.570
我希望你能看一下 我对改善科室的建议
I'd hoped you would have viewed my ideas for improving the department.

958
00:43:41.360 --> 00:43:43.440
我期待能得到你的反馈
I was looking forward to getting some feedback from you.

959
00:43:43.450 --> 00:43:45.860
好吧 我觉得这个科室运行地很好
Okay, well, I think the department

960
00:43:45.860 --> 00:43:46.780
从各方面来看都是
functions pretty well, all things considered.

961
00:43:46.780 --> 00:43:49.830
我是说 我们和大多数急诊 面临着同样的挑战
I mean, we face the same challenges that most emergency departments face.

962
00:43:49.830 --> 00:43:51.870
我们以生成式人工智能为例
Let's take generative AI, for instance.

963
00:43:51.870 --> 00:43:54.330
急诊科医生花费40%的时间写病历
ER doctors spend 40% of their time charting,

964
00:43:54.330 --> 00:43:56.830
只有28%的时间在患者床旁
only 28% of their time at the bedside.

965
00:43:58.750 --> 00:44:00.590
这个数据不准确吧
That doesn't sound accurate.

966
00:44:00.590 --> 00:44:03.050
我在方案里附上了我的研究 是啊
I've included the study in my packet. Right.

967
00:44:03.050 --> 00:44:05.970
而患者护照已被证明能提升满意度
And patient passports have been shown to increase satisfaction

968
00:44:05.970 --> 00:44:07.760
因为上面会显示每个阶段...
because they show the time required

969
00:44:07.760 --> 00:44:10.260
是的 我这儿有 ...需要等待的时间
for each phase of the visit. Yeah, I got it right here.

970
00:44:10.260 --> 00:44:11.930
什么情况? 一个有攻击性的大学生
What do you got? Combative college kid.

971
00:44:11.930 --> 00:44:14.390
在图书馆突然失控 被校园保安用电击枪击中了脖子
Flipped out in the library, Tased in the neck by campus security.

972
00:44:14.390 --> 00:44:15.930
五支咪达唑仑都没能放倒他
5 midazolam didn't touch him.

973
00:44:15.940 --> 00:44:17.440
你能他妈的别碰我吗?
Will you get the fuck off me?

974
00:44:17.440 --> 00:44:20.400
2901 混蛋!走开!
2901! 2901, motherfucker! Get off!

975
00:44:21.230 --> 00:44:22.070
去你妈的!
Fuck you, man!

976
00:44:22.070 --> 00:44:23.860
你还要继续聊聊你的方案吗?
Want to tell me some more about your ideas?

977
00:44:24.940 --> 00:44:26.070
晚点再说吧 放我出去!
Maybe later. Let me out!

978
00:44:26.070 --> 00:44:27.740
他妈的放我出去!
Let me the fuck out!

979
00:44:27.740 --> 00:44:28.990
放我出去!
Let me out! Let me out!

980
00:45:52.530 --> 00:45:54.530
翻译:肖雪

